WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The other woman also, she gave birth to another child.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.000
After technology and entertainment there is a third thing which is a must.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
She gave birth to Tubalkai and he was the inventor of Lotesh.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:35.000
He knew how to polish and to create, to fashion copper and iron.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Iron and copper which is the best thing for weapons.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:53.000
In other words, now that was the nuclear age of those days.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:07.000
You know, to create an object and a barzell in those days was certainly much more difficult than for us today to make an atomic bomb.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:23.000
Now, what is important is that from the time we have finally, first one is, you know, progress in economic by having these shepherds, you know, that's economic.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:31.000
Then second is entertainment and then after this the culmination of society, war.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:38.000
What was his name, this one?

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:39.000
Tubalkai.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Tubalkai.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:41.000
Tubalkai.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.000
Tubalkai.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:46.000
What time is it now?

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Twenty-five.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:52.000
You want Tubalkai and another one?

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.000
Stop, stop, stop.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:05.000
But isn't it interesting the way the Bible, in a very subtle way, tells us about the three most important things of modern society?

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:10.000
Economic, entertainment and army.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:14.000
How about modern society?

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:18.000
That's part of the second one, that's entertainment.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:22.000
No, and I think Adam ruled sex.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:27.000
Yeah, no, but not as an entertainment, not as a ways of entertainment.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.000
Amen.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.000
Yes, yes.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:44.000
All the progress that society had in the days of Cain, they progressed enormously, I mean, relatively to what they were before.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:49.000
And now we're going to see how people behave within that society.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:56.000
And as we say, for a sample, you know, one button is enough to see a sample, yes?

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:59.000
Now if you want to buy a button, you see one button, it's a good sample.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:11.000
Now we're going to see some people there, how they behave, and this will be a good example of, you know, how people, you know, live in affluent society.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.000
How many generations was this after...

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:15.000
Adam, that's seventh generation.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:17.000
Seventh, even after Tubalkai?

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:25.000
Yeah, because they were the children of Lamech, Lamech was the father of these people, of these boys, of these bright boys.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.000
They were eight, yes.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:29.000
And Lamech was the father of these bright boys.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:32.000
These are descendants of Cain.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:34.000
Cain.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:36.000
He killed him.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:50.000
And Lamech, the father of these bright boys, tells to his wives,

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:55.000
Listen to what I'm saying.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:04:00.000
You wives of Lamech, he's saying a poem.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:03.000
Listen to what I'm saying.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:04.000
It's the same thing in different words.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:07.000
That's part of the Hebrew style of poetry.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:12.000
In other words, we see that the father of these bright boys was an intellectual.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:14.000
And he said,

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:17.000
He's telling, the poem is the following,

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:24.000
I killed a man because he wounded me.

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:28.000
It's repeating the same thing.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:29.000
A young man,

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.000
He's a young man.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:35.000
The man that I killed was not an old man, but he's showing, you know,

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:38.000
A young man, because he wounded me.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:43.000
Somebody wounded him, and he killed him.

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:45.000
And why?

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:46.000
A time you come Cain.

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:51.000
God said that whoever kills Cain, he will be punished seven times.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:54.000
By Lamech, but if somebody wounds Lamech,

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:58.000
77 times.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:01.000
Very interesting, no?

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:08.000
In other words, the father of these bright boys, who was an intellectual, says like this,

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:12.000
God says that whoever kills Cain, yes,

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:16.000
Should be punished seven times.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:22.000
Now, I say, whoever kills or touches, or whatever it is, Lamech,

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.000
Seven times seven.

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:29.000
So, therefore, somebody wounded him, and he killed him.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:31.000
You see?

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:32.000
You see?

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:33.000
You see?

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:38.000
So, that's why I say, so here you see the way people react

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:43.000
In this type of affluent, super affluent society,

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:51.000
And how the intellectuals, they have the capacity or the ability to rationalize anything they want.

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:55.000
It's a very good example, very subtle, and I think it's valid even for today.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:59.000
Some people, no, I'm not saying politics, I really don't know.

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:04.000
The only person who knows politics is Mr. Cohen,

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:14.000
And I mean to say it's allowed, it's forbidden for a person to speak about a subject when somebody who knows more is present.

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:16.000
I'll leave the room.

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:19.000
If I'm holding you back, I'll leave the room right now.

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.000
So, but this is interesting.

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:28.000
Now, some, the Nasr of the Hagamin says that you know who this person was when he killed?

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:31.000
Cain.

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:36.000
That's why his own grandfather saw a young man, because he still was strong, Cain.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.000
That is the Deasha, you know?

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:44.000
In other words, Cain, you know, bothered him a little bit, you know, and he killed him.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:48.000
And Lamech killed Cain.

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:50.000
That's right.

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:53.000
He still was around, because they lived for a thousand years.

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:57.000
And he killed his own grandfather, and he says very simply,

00:06:57.000 --> 00:07:02.000
Whoever kills Cain seven times, whoever touches Lamech, seven times seven.

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:04.000
You know?

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:06.000
He was subject to the Christ.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:08.000
Yes, but he didn't care. He made a point.

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:10.000
He said this to his wife.

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:15.000
Obviously he wanted to show off in front of his intellect, to his ala and salam, yes?

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:18.000
Which were, you know, one was very beautiful, one knew how to sing,

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:22.000
and he was unable to get the perfect combination, as you know.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:27.000
So this shows about the human beings, how they react when everything is, you know,

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:32.000
the bright children, they have children, where one of them is the head of a military industrial complex,

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:36.000
the other one is the head of an economic, you know, organization,

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:39.000
and the other one is the head of the, I don't know, NGC, and so on.

