So the father, you know, this intellectual, you know, and so on,

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:44.000
you see what he does, he just goes on and on.

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.000
He's intellectual, but not very smart.

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:48.000
No intellectual is smart.

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:49.000
That's right.

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:51.000
You see, if you don't believe me, it is.

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:58.000
You see, the best, the greatest blessing for any Syrian is when intellectuals come to buy radios to your stores.

