What?

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:34.000
A very general anti-intellectual statement.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:37.000
Once I had a...

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:39.000
Just a couple of statements from me.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:41.000
I went to borrow a Hebrew book from somebody.

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:43.000
So I had the Hebrew book with me.

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:45.000
Somebody, a man, sees me.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.000
He starts looking at me.

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:47.000
He sees I have a Hebrew book.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:48.000
He comes to me and says,

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:51.000
You know, this book is wisdom.

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:54.000
You know, what we study in school is only science.

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:55.000
Beautiful.

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:57.000
This is wisdom, he says.

00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:59.000
What we study in school is only science.

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:03.000
And there is a difference between science and wisdom.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:07.000
What's the difference between a rabbi and an intellectual?

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:12.000
What's the difference between a rabbi and an intellectual?

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:17.000
Between a hakam and an intellectual is that a hakam knows.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:19.000
In other words, it's not just assuming things.

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:21.000
He has the experience.

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:22.000
He has the contact with human beings.

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:23.000
He has the tradition.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:24.000
He has intelligence.

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:25.000
And the maturity.

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:26.000
You see?

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:30.000
But it's very simple to be sitting in a sort of an ivory tower

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:33.000
and tell you how the world should go

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:35.000
without having any experience whatsoever.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:37.000
This is what I'm saying.

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:40.000
Intellectuals who have no contact or no experience with life

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:43.000
and they tell you, you know...

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:45.000
But, I'm sorry.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:49.000
I had too much coffee, so this is too much for me.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:52.000
I have deep respect for rabbis because they have a rich intellect.

