00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:08.000
Now, let's continue.

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:14.000
Gentlemen.

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:19.000
That's a euphemism.

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:21.000
He had relations with his wife.

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:25.000
For the first time, it says

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:28.000
She gave birth to a son.

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:33.000
And she called him Sheikh.

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:34.000
Why?

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:36.000
Now, what does it mean Sheikh?

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:38.000
Sheikh in Hebrew means foundation.

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:40.000
He is the foundation.

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:43.000
And Sheikh, as a matter of fact, became the foundation of mankind

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:47.000
because all the children of Cain were destroyed in the Mabul.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:51.000
The Mabul that was a result of this technology and so on

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:53.000
destroyed them.

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:56.000
But he gave birth to Elohim.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:57.000
It's a different thing.

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:59.000
God gave me as a foundation

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:02.000
another posterity

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:05.000
at heaven, instead of heaven, because of Cain.

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:08.000
He also gave birth to a son.

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:12.000
Also, not only did he give birth to a son,

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:16.000
but he had the ability of giving birth to a son.

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:19.000
By God, a human being.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:21.000
He called him a human being, which means man.

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:23.000
He called him Shachatar Abu.

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:24.000
What was the name of his father?

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:25.000
Alam.

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:27.000
So, similar to Alam,

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:30.000
Enosh, which means human being, person.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:33.000
Azulhal.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:39.000
Then, mankind started recognizing or calling

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:41.000
in the name of God.

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:42.000
Which means,

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:44.000
the children of Cain,

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:47.000
they were very progressive in materialism.

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:49.000
The children of Sheikh,

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:51.000
they were the inventors of

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:53.000
Liqlob Hashem Adonai.

