00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:02.000
But we mean men as human, mankind.

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.000
And therefore it says,

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:09.000
Men, it comprises female and male.

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:10.000
Yes?

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:12.000
And according to the Torah,

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:13.000
both are humans,

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:14.000
both have the same rights,

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:16.000
or are equal in the eyes of the Lord.

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:17.000
Yes.

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:20.000
But we call either a man or a woman,

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:22.000
it's under the category of Adam.

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:23.000
And Adam, you know,

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.000
